### Meredian backend — collection de requêtes de test
### À utiliser avec l'extension VS Code "REST Client" (humao.rest-client).
### Exécute d'abord "login admin" ou "register", copie l'accessToken renvoyé
### dans la variable @token ci-dessous.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = colle-ici-un-access-token
@adminEmail = admin@meredian.io
@adminPassword = ChangeMe!2026

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Santé
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Authentification
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Inscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Awa Ndiaye",
  "email": "awa@example.com",
  "password": "MotDePasse!2026"
}

### Connexion (utilisateur)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "awa@example.com",
  "password": "MotDePasse!2026"
}

### Connexion admin (compte créé par le seed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Profil de l'utilisateur connecté
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Catalogue public
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Tous les cours
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses

### Filtres
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?category=Informatique&level=Formation Pro&query=react

### Détail d'un cours (remplacer :id par un UUID réel)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Structure complète (modules + sections)
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/modules

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Gestion des cours (admin)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Créer un cours
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "INF-401",
  "title": "Architecture logicielle",
  "category": "Informatique",
  "level": "L3",
  "template": "Mixte",
  "price": 20000,
  "duration": "8h",
  "description": "Patrons d'architecture, modularité, dette technique."
}

### Modifier un cours
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 18000, "isFree": false }

### Supprimer un cours
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ajouter un module
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/modules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Introduction", "orderIndex": 0 }

### Modifier un module
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/modules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Introduction générale" }

### Supprimer un module
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/modules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ajouter une section — lecture
POST {{baseUrl}}/modules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pourquoi l'architecture compte",
  "type": "reading",
  "duration": "8 min",
  "body": "# Introduction\n\nTexte enrichi en markdown..."
}

### Ajouter une section — vidéo
POST {{baseUrl}}/modules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Démo en direct",
  "type": "video",
  "practical": true,
  "duration": "18 min",
  "videoUrl": "https://stream.example.com/abc.m3u8"
}

### Ajouter une section — images
POST {{baseUrl}}/modules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Galerie",
  "type": "image",
  "duration": "5 photos",
  "photos": [
    { "url": "https://cdn.example.com/1.jpg", "caption": "Schéma 1" },
    { "url": "https://cdn.example.com/2.jpg", "caption": "Schéma 2" }
  ]
}

### Ajouter une section — quiz
POST {{baseUrl}}/modules/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Quiz de fin de module",
  "type": "quiz",
  "duration": "1 évaluation",
  "quiz": [
    {
      "question": "Quel principe favorise la modularité ?",
      "options": ["Le couplage fort", "La séparation des responsabilités", "La duplication"],
      "correctIndex": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Mettre à jour une section (le contenu traité selon son type)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/sections/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Contenu mis à jour" }

### Supprimer une section
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sections/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Progression (utilisateur connecté)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### S'inscrire à un cours (gratuit → immédiat ; payant → paiement requis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mes cours + progression
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marquer une section comme complétée
POST {{baseUrl}}/sections/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paiements
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Initier un paiement (MOCK_PAYMENTS=true → confirmé immédiatement)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemType": "course", "itemId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }

### Mes paiements
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Webhook Naboopay (simulation). La signature = HMAC-SHA256 hex du corps brut
### avec NABOOPAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET. En mode mock, l'en-tête peut être omis.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
x-naboopay-signature: (hmac-sha256-hex-du-corps)

{ "reference": "MRD-...", "status": "confirmed" }

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Accompagnement
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Créneaux de mentorat + offres
GET {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/slots

### Réserver un créneau
POST {{baseUrl}}/mentoring/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "durationMinutes": 30, "scheduledAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00.000Z" }

### Sessions Q&R à venir
GET {{baseUrl}}/qa-sessions

### S'inscrire à une session Q&R
POST {{baseUrl}}/qa-sessions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/register
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Créer une session Q&R (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/qa-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Révisions algorithmique",
  "scheduledAt": "2026-11-01T17:00:00.000Z",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "maxSpots": 15
}

### Soumettre un travail à corriger
POST {{baseUrl}}/work-submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fileUrl": "https://files.example.com/devoir.pdf", "note": "Dissertation de droit constitutionnel" }

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vitrine & contact
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Vitrine publique
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile

### Mettre à jour le profil (admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bio": "Nouvelle bio", "location": "Dakar, Sénégal" }

### Ajouter une compétence (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "category": "Informatique", "name": "Docker" }

### Ajouter une réalisation (admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/works
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bot Discord open-source", "category": "Informatique", "description": "..." }

### Formulaire de contact (public)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Recruteur X", "email": "rh@entreprise.com", "message": "Bonjour, votre profil nous intéresse." }

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Statistiques admin
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
### Tableau de bord
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Messages de contact
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Marquer un message comme lu
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/contact-messages/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/read
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
